# Pull fork before work

At the start of every agent run (before other work):

1. Treat `origin` as the user's fork: `https://github.com/wei0py/agent-runtime-platform.git`
2. Run `git fetch origin`
3. Pull the current branch from origin when tracking is set:
   - `git pull --ff-only origin <current-branch>`
4. If the current branch has no remote tracking branch yet, still fetch and report `origin/main` and `origin/<branch>` status; do not force-reset local work
5. Briefly report whether the branch was already up to date or which commits were pulled

Do this first on every new run. Do not skip it because the working tree looks clean.
